:21.810">lightly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.230" end="00:25.650"><span begin="00:22.230" end="00:22.500">I </span><span begin="00:22.500" end="00:22.740">don't </span><span begin="00:22.740" end="00:23.160">even </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.520">wanna </span><span begin="00:23.520" end="00:23.650">*</span><span begin="00:23.650" end="00:23.780">*</span><span begin="00:23.780" end="00:23.910">*</span><span begin="00:23.910" end="00:24.040">*</span><span begin="00:24.040" end="00:24.180">, </span><span begin="00:24.180" end="00:24.300">I </span><span begin="00:24.300" end="00:24.540">just </span><span begin="00:24.540" end="00:25.080">like </span><span begin="00:25.080" end="00:25.410">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.650" end="00:30.000"><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:25.800">I </span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:26.190">thought </span><span begin="00:26.190" end="00:26.310">I </span><span begin="00:26.310" end="00:26.370"> </span><span begin="00:26.370" end="00:26.790">only </span><span begin="00:26.790" end="00:27.270">liked </span><span begin="00:27.270" end="00:27.810">drugs</span><span begin="00:27.810" end="00:27.810">, </span><span begin="00:27.810" end="00:27.930">I'm </span><span begin="00:27.930" end="00:28.680">surprised </span><span begin="00:28.680" end="00:29.880"> </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:29.940">too </span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:29.940">（</span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:30.000">Ayy</span><span begin="00:30.000" end="00:30.000">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.000" end="00:32.910"><span begin="00:30.000" end="00:30.330">Walk </span><span begin="00:30.330" end="00:30.450">with </span><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.840">me</span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:31.170">, </span><span begin="00:31.170" end="00:31.350">I'm </span><span begin="00:31.350" end="00:31.620">looking </span><span begin="00:31.620" end="00:31.830">for </span><span begin="00:31.830" end="00:32.640">honesty </span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:32.700">（</span><span begin="00:32.700" end="00:32.910">Yeah</span><span begin="00:32.910" end="00:32.910">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.910" end="00:33.810"><span begin="00:32.910" end="00:33.090">Is </span><span begin="00:33.090" end="00:33.270">that </span><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.450">your </span><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.630">boyfriend</span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.810">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.810" end="00:34.710"><span begin="00:33.810" end="00:33.900">He </span><span begin="00:33.900" end="00:34.080">was </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.410">watching </span><span begin="00:34.410" end="00:34.710">again</span><span begin="00:34.710" end="00:34.710">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.710" end="00:36.780"><span begin="00:34.710" end="00:34.860">Girl </span><span begin="00:34.860" end="00:34.950">I </span><span begin="00:34.950" end="00:35.160">think </span><span begin="00:35.160" end="00:35.310">that </span><span begin="00:35.310" end="00:35.520">he's </span><span begin="00:35.520" end="00:35.910">onto </span><span begin="00:35.910" end="00:36.330">me </span><span begin="00:36.330" end="00:36.360">（</span><span begin="00:36.360" end="00:36.570">Yeah</span><span begin="00:36.570" end="00:36.780">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.780" end="00:40.200"><span begin="00:36.780" end="00:36.960">That </span><span begin="00:36.960" end="00:37.260">doesn't </span><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:37.680">bother </span><span begin="00:37.680" end="00:37.980">me</span><span begin="00:37.980" end="00:38.460">, </span><span begin="00:38.460" end="00:38.580">I </span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:38.790">deal </span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:38.880">with </span><span begin="00:38.880" end="00:39.060">this </span><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.750">constantly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.200" end="00:41.190"><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.410">If </span><span begin="00:40.410" end="00:40.590">he's </span><span begin="00:40.590" end="00:40.770">got </span><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.830">a </span><span begin="00:40.830" end="00:41.190">problem</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.190" end="00:44.820"><span begin="00:41.190" end="00:41.310">Then </span><span begin="00:41.310" end="00:41.670">tell </span><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:41.820">that </span><span begin="00:41.820" end="00:42.000">lil' </span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.000">*</span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.000">*</span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.000">*</span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.000">*</span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.000">* </span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.090">to </span><span begin="00:42.090" end="00:42.330">come </span><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:42.510">over </span><span begin="00:42.510" end="00:42.660">and </span><span begin="00:42.660" end="00:43.020">talk </span><span begin="00:43.020" end="00:43.170">to </span><span begin="00:43.170" end="00:43.980">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.820" end="00:48.150"><span begin="00:44.820" end="00:44.970">I'm </span><span begin="00:44.970" end="00:45.300">almost </span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:45.390">too </span><span begin="00:45.390" end="00:45.720">high </span><span begin="00:45.720" end="00:45.930">for </span><span begin="00:45.930" end="00:46.770">this </span><span begin="00:46.770" end="00:46.770">（</span><span begin="00:46.770" end="00:47.640">Yeah</span><span begin="00:47.640" end="00:48.150">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.150" end="00:53.070"><span begin="00:48.150" end="00:48.270">I </span><span begin="00:48.270" end="00:48.450">see </span><span begin="00:48.450" end="00:48.570">your </span><span begin="00:48.570" end="00:49.620">paranoia</span><span begin="00:49.620" end="00:49.620">, </span><span begin="00:49.620" end="00:49.650">I </span><span begin="00:49.650" end="00:49.800">know </span><span begin="00:49.800" end="00:49.890">it's </span><span begin="00:49.890" end="00:51.330">scandalous </span><span begin="00:51.330" end="00:51.360">（</span><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:52.230">Yeah</span><span begin="00:52.230" end="00:53.070">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.070" end="00:54.720"><span begin="00:53.070" end="00:53.370">Take </span><span begin="00:53.370" end="00:53.430">a </span><span begin="00:53.430" end="00:53.580">little </span><span begin="00:53.580" end="00:53.820">dip </span><span begin="00:53.820" end="00:53.910">of </span><span begin="00:53.910" end="00:54.000">the </span><span begin="00:54.000" end="00:54.540">candy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.720" end="00:56.760"><span begin="00:54.720" end="00:54.990">See</span><span begin="00:54.990" end="00:54.990">, </span><span begin="00:54.990" end="00:55.170">you </span><span begin="00:55.170" end="00:55.260">were </span><span begin="00:55.260" end="00:55.680">supposed </span><span begin="00:55.680" end="00:55.740">to </span><span begin="00:55.740" end="00:55.920">get </span><span begin="00:55.920" end="00:56.370">married</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.760" end="00:58.080"><span begin="00:56.760" end="00:57.000">You </span><span begin="00:57.000" end="00:57.060">were </span><span begin="00:57.060" end="00:57.210">su</span><span begin="00:57.210" end="00:57.240">— </span><span begin="00:57.240" end="00:57.660">（</span><span begin="00:57.660" end="00:58.050">Yeah</span><span begin="00:58.050" end="00:58.080">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.080" end="01:01.380"><span begin="00:58.080" end="00:59.040">Hard </span><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.550">drugs</span><span begin="00:59.550" end="01:00.360">, </span><span begin="01:00.360" end="01:00.750">no </span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:01.380">trust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.380" end="01:05.010"><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:01.700">*</span><span begin="01:01.700" end="01:02.020">*</span><span begin="01:02.020" end="01:02.340">*</span><span begin="01:02.340" end="01:02.670">* </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.150">love</span><span begin="01:03.150" end="01:03.150">, </span><span begin="01:03.150" end="01:03.330">we </span><span begin="01:03.330" end="01:03.600">can </span><span begin="01:03.600" end="01:03.870">do </span><span begin="01:03.870" end="01:04.140">this </span><span begin="01:04.140" end="01:04.170">*</span><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.200">*</span><span begin="01:04.200" end="01:04.230">*</span><span begin="01:04.230" end="01:04.290">* </span><span begin="01:04.290" end="01:05.010">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.010" end="01:08.400"><span begin="01:05.010" end="01:05.250">If </span><span begin="01:05.250" end="01:05.460">it's </span><span begin="01:05.460" end="01:05.940">lust</span><span begin="01:05.940" end="01:05.940">, </span><span begin="01:05.940" end="01:06.360">yeah</span><span begin="01:06.360" end="01:06.360">, </span><span begin="01:06.360" end="01:07.650">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.400" end="01:12.840"><span begin="01:08.400" end="01:09.150">Listen </span><span begin="01:09.150" end="01:09.480">up</span><span begin="01:09.480" end="01:09.480">, </span><span begin="01:09.480" end="01:11.100">yeah </span><span begin="01:11.100" end="01:11.390">（</span><span begin="01:11.390" end="01:11.680">*</span><span begin="01:11.680" end="01:11.970">*</span><span begin="01:11.970" end="01:12.260">*</span><span begin="01:12.260" end="01:12.550">*</span><span begin="01:12.550" end="01:12.840">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.840" end="01:15.930"><span begin="01:12.840" end="01:13.050">But </span><span begin="01:13.050" end="01:13.560">who </span><span begin="01:13.560" end="01:14.520">cares</span><span begin="01:14.520" end="01:14.700">? </span><span begin="01:14.700" end="01:14.940">I </span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:15.450">give </spa